title: "Matching OCRS Separation Certificates: General Non-Bipartite Upper Bounds (< 0.37868), Vanishing & Tree Global-Coin Lower Bounds (> 0.38267), and Vanishing Bipartite Upper Bounds (<= 0.38603)"
type: software
